  <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">Agreement to Comply with Rules and Regulations of LSUHSC Campus Parking</div>
  <p>As a condition of receiving parking privileges from the LSUHSC, I agree to comply with all rules and requirements contained in the parking regulations, a copy of which I acknowledge receipt of. I understand that non-compliance can result in my receipt of a notice of violation citation with monetary penalty assessed in accordance with the schedule of violation fees which is a part of the parking regulations.</p>
  <p>I further acknowledge, agree, and authorize the LSU Health Sciences Center - New Orleans to deduct parking fees from my payroll check as authorized by my employment agreement. I understand that this deduction is subject to change based upon my employment status and that I will be notified of any changes to the deduction amount.</p>
  <p>My signature to this document indicates I have read, understood, and will comply with the requirements of this document.</p>
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div>
      <label>Signature:</label>
      <input type="text" style="width: 300px;" data-field="signature" value="{{ signature }}">
    </div>
    <div>
      <label>Date:</label>
